      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for the summary. It's a good start, but it feels a little bit too brief for a phone this important to our launch. The word count is a bit low, so the \"comprehensiveness score\" is also quite low. \n\nCould you expand on this? I really need more depth for each of these points—maybe go into more detail about the specific camera feedback or the software/UI aspects. Don't just repeat what you said, but try to be much more thorough so we get a higher score and a more complete picture for the stakeholders. I'm looking for a much longer, more detailed breakdown.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
